  {
    "name": "pdo log chunk 0 response",
    "dir": "rx",
    "cmd": 17,
    "write": false,
    "payload": "008813841305010000",
    "frame": "0b11008813841305010000",
    "midi": "800000 90000b 900101 900000 900808 900103 900804 900103 900005 900001 900000 900000 a00000",
    "usbmidi": "08800000 0990000b 09900101 09900000 09900808 09900103 09900804 09900103 09900005 09900001 09900000 09900000 0aa00000",
    "note": "Payload is [chunkId, 8 data bytes] = 11-byte frame (§9.1). The data is the head of the log blob, which is LITTLE-endian unlike the rest of the protocol: target 0x1388=5000 mV, measured 0x1384=4996 mV, 5 PDOs received, PDO 1 selected, flags 0."
  },
