  {
    "name": "read authlock",
    "dir": "tx",
    "cmd": 22,
    "write": false,
    "payload": "",
    "frame": "0216",
    "midi": "800000 900002 900106 a00000",
    "usbmidi": "08800000 09900002 09900106 0aa00000",
    "note": "The read answers [0x16, level] -- the command code echoed a second time, then the level (SPEC.md §14, question 8: tx 02 16 -> rx 04 16 16 00). The vendor client's SECOND payload byte was never an off-by-one; the write still puts the level in the FIRST (§6.3)."
  },
